      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Frame this concern around the need for shared social capital, rather than cultural exclusion. Argue that strong, common civic traditions create the necessary mutual understanding for collective problem-solving across all groups. Emphasize that foundational values allow diverse populations to build a *new* cohesive society, building upon a known national bedrock. This shifts the focus from rejecting difference to protecting the underlying mechanisms of stability.",
