      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Yes, there is a critical point where rigid adherence to tradition becomes a barrier to necessary progress. An uncritical insistence on the past can stifle innovation and prevent a society from adapting to modern global challenges. A healthy national identity must be dynamic, incorporating new ideas while preserving fundamental ethical values. The goal should therefore be to maintain a core spirit of the culture while remaining open to evolution.",
      "source": "target",
